<noinclude>
{{Documentation|doc=
This provides one or more toggle boxes to display the latest modding news on the wiki. This is most notably used in {{ll|Template:Navbar modding}} to easily show users the latest updates and changes related to modding with an easy access from any modding pages to not miss them.

Latest modding news are retrieved manually from a diff comparison between the previous update files and the latest update files. The [[Decompiling game code|decompiled java files]] are examined as well as the [[Game files#Media folder|media folder]]. 

== Usage ==
{{tlx|ModdingNews}}
{{ModdingNews}}

== See also ==
{{ll|Template:ToggleBox}}
}}
</noinclude><includeonly>{{ToggleBox|title=<div style="text-align: center;">[[Build 42.22.0]] Modding News (October 27th, 2026)</div>|id=modding-news|class=blue|content=
''The following modding changes are provided unofficially by parsing the latest [[game files]] for interesting changes that may affect modding or be useful to modders.''

* <code>.bik</code> video files can now be loaded from modded files! These can most notably be used by custom maps to show previews of their map in the spawn selection menu.
* New [[ActionGroup|action groups]] and [[AnimState|anim states]] for animations:
** climbLadder
** climbLadderDown
** forceopendoorleft
** forceopendoorright
** forceopengaragedoor
** forceopenwindow
* New ButcheringUtil method: {{Code|lang=lua|ButcheringUtil.hasBucket}}
* <code>.bank</code> sound files moved from <code>media/sound/banks/Desktop</code> to <code>media/sound/banks</code>
* Tile definition files moved from <code>media</code> to <code>media/tile_definitions</code>
* New IsoGameCharacter methods which could prove useful:
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.forceOpenWindowOrDoor}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.getClimbLadderDown}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.isClimbingLadder}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.isClimbingDownLadder}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.getClimbZ}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.faceThisEdgeElement}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.getPrimaryHandMask}} and {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.getSecondaryHandMask}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.setPrimaryHandMask}} and {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.setSecondaryHandMask}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.canPerformHandToHandCombat}} (moved from IsoPlayer)
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.canPerformHandToHandCombatWithPrimary}} and {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.canPerformHandToHandCombatWithSecondary}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.dropHandItemForHandToHand}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.isNotHoldingHandWeapon}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.isHeadCameraZ}} and {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.setHeadCameraZ}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.getBaseForceOpenChance}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoGameCharacter.exertForForcing}}
* New IsoPlayer methods which could prove useful:
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPlayer.isPlayer}} (static method, can pass any object instance)
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPlayer.syncClothing}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPlayer.findPlayerMP}} (seems to provide a method to find a specific player based on comparison parameters), example usage in new method {{Code|lang=java|IsoPlayer.anyPlayerMP}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPlayer.isClimbLoop}}
* New IsoPropertyTypes:
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPropertyType.LADDER_N}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPropertyType.LADDER_S}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPropertyType.LADDER_E}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoPropertyType.LADDER_W}}
* New InventoryItem methods which could prove useful:
** {{Code|lang=java|InventoryItem.isAvailableFluidContainer}}
** {{Code|lang=java|InventoryItem.isHeavyItem}}
** {{Code|lang=java|InventoryItem.canPerformHandToHandWithItem}}
** {{Code|lang=java|InventoryItem.awardMaintenanceXP}}
* Other random class notable methods:
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoMovingObject.getFallZ}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IsoObject.isType}}
* New cheat available in the [[Lua debugger]]: IgnoreFalling
* Newly exposed classes:
** {{Code|lang=java|ForceOpenState}}
** {{Code|lang=java|ForceOpenState.ForcingType}}
** {{Code|lang=java|ILockableDoor}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IForceableDoor}}
** {{Code|lang=java|IForceablePortal}}
** {{Code|lang=java|GridSquareEdgeElement}}
* Global methods:
** {{Code|lang=java|isPlayerProfileReceived}}
** {{Code|lang=java|deletePlayerSave}} (removed)
** {{Code|lang=java|createStory}} (removed)
** {{Code|lang=java|rejectMedicalCheck}}
* New animnode conditions and events, see [[github:PZ-Wiki-Modding/pz-animsets-parser/commit/6f8cc42f2d5b890fae1ed048dd446862e5c71517|here]] for the details.
* New item tags and sound keys, see [[github:PZ-Wiki-Modding/pz-java-parser/commit/d6bf6e480d621c887912d58338dff8bc9fa54f76|here]] for the details.
* New [[Lua event]]: <code>OnElectricityChanged</code>
}}<includeonly/>
